{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲清楚地解释了珍惜之物仍有分量为何使他不愿被失落定义，以及维持姿态的努力为何反而加深眷恋、使再次聚力更急更不安；但它对身体反应如何先于明确念头、38–43与44–65小节的具体转折交代较少，也没有充分区分自我控制与不甘心退让这两种不必合一的动因。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙把旧日亲近真实存在却无法重新拥有的矛盾、身体先收紧而后借尊严与克制重新组织自己的过程，以及这种办法暂时有效却因反复维持而加剧焦灼的机制串联起来，并用乐段起伏和三连音具体说明第二次聚力为何更急、末尾为何仍无法安定；不足是H1、H2、M等未在题面解释的标签增加了理解负担，个别关于首次高涨后心理变化的推断也超出了听感记录的明确描述。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"乙保留了甲关于珍惜、失落、自我控制与眷恋之间的核心因果链，并进一步说明身体反应、应对方式的暂时效果及其反过来加重焦灼的过程，还具体解释了段落内部的转折并保留抵抗动机的独立可能性；标签不透明和少量推断虽是缺点，但不足以抵消这些机制解释上的增益。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "77c629ae-7de3-4cc7-a138-4b8a1036633f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T133939747264Z", "elapsed_seconds": 75.094, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:40:54.846420+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "383cc14628f0429412d2ca473c3a75dcf384cbf2dd1c18f28448dd6fd92b33b7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py":